{
  "suite": "pivot_layout",
  "kind": "workbook",
  "description": "Layout and filtering coverage for the pivot oracle: Compact vs Tabular vs Outline report layout, subtotal rendering for multi-level row hierarchies, and manual item filters that hide row / column items. Each case reuses a small sales dataset on a \"Data\" sheet and pivots onto \"Report\". No golden is committed: pivot golden generation needs a Windows + Excel host.",
